                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The newest game in the series as of January 2020.  Lynn is possessed by evil and compelled to become the next Witch Queen.  Can Edward stop the coronation before Lynn becomes tainted forever?\n\nAnother strong game in the excellent Witches' Legacy series.\n\nPros:\n- beautiful art\n- good voice acting (improved over previous for Edward and Lynn)\n- fully interactive map (including collectables) and integrated walk-through guide\n- lots of puzzles and HO scenes\n- very nice music (some tracks are too short, though)\n- a good story (for this genre)\n\nCons:\n- story feels rushed toward end especially in bonus chapter\n- puzzles have gotten too easy (a couple felt pointless, not enough challenges)\n- the first main HO scene is too odd and revisited too often\n- less coherent world building (too many things seem completely random, compared to previous chapters)\n\nOverall:  entertaining and a very decent length, especially for the price; I still highly recommend this series! Slightly less engaging than earlier entries in the series, for me.",
